<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">Additionally, the Company has provided Note 11 &#8211; Quarterly Financial
Data (unaudited and restated) to present the impact of the above restatements on the unaudited quarterly financial information for the
period ended September 30, 2023.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify">The Company&#8217;s prior and updated accounting for
the errors described above do not have any effect on the Company&#8217;s previously reported cash or cash flows.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_C03_gL3SOECAPPATT-CTUD_zjl0AJp8VmS4"><ix:continuation continuedAt="ConU002183-02" id="ConU002183-01"><span><span>&#160;</span></span></ix:continuation></span></p>

