                                                                              estimated fair value of $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--FairValueAdjustmentOfWarrants_c20220101__20221231__us-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--AugustTwoThousandAndTwentyTwoNotesMember_zJolIab5z3z"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:FairValueAdjustmentOfWarrants" contextRef="From2022-01-012022-12-31_custom_AugustTwoThousandAndTwentyTwoNotesMember" id="Fact003156" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">121,875</ix:nonFraction></span>.</p>
